= Currency stabilisation

A financial crisis — a budget below −2 B or inflation of at least 20% a month for two months — opens the one currency reform. Choosing a variant prepares it (1 T); its launch with the currency law and the necessary financing waits in the agenda (1 T). When it is completed the złoty ends the marka pressures and the ordinary emission.

