@rapid_cuts
title: Rapid stabilisation with savings
subtitle: Costs the budget 2 units a month for three months; needs adopted cuts of at least 1 budget unit; the credit shock grows for three months from the launch (+10).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'rapid_cuts').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_rapid_cuts_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'rapid_cuts');
!}
go-to: result

@protected
title: Stabilisation with protections and a burden on wealth
subtitle: Costs the budget 2 units a month for three months; needs a protection for the unemployed and its financing; the same credit shock.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'protected').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_protected_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'protected');
!}
go-to: result

@gradual
title: Gradual limitation of emission
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit a month for five months; the credit shock grows for five months (+5); the pressure on the marka lasts longer.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'gradual').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_gradual_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'gradual');
!}
go-to: result

